Recompiling function fn in /data/users/williamwen/pytorch/playground2.py:9
    triggered by the following guard failure(s):
    - 0/0: cl.__closure__[1].cell_contents == 1                     # return x + n1 + n2  # playground2.py:5 in inner
    - User stack trace:
    -   File "/data/users/williamwen/pytorch/playground2.py", line 11, in fn
    -     return cl(x)
